// Committed defaults for the two owner-local build settings. Both app projects
// point their Debug and Release configurations at this file; the real values
// live in Local.xcconfig, which is gitignored and included LAST so it wins.
//
// The defaults stay here rather than in project.yml for two reasons: a value in
// project.yml is destroyed by any git operation and re-baked into Info.plist by
// `xcodegen generate`, and keeping a committed empty default is what lets a
// fresh clone build and test on the simulator with no local file at all. An
// empty Stripe key is fail-closed at runtime (card payment hidden, cash only);
// an empty team is fine for the simulator and blocks only device signing.

STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY =
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
